 "tagNotes": "IDs from manual 9.9 / Figure 9-17 (TU05): red far-side CELL 30-33, red audience CELL 34-37, blue audience CELL 38-41, blue far-side CELL 42-45. The CAD has one sticker per CELL without the tag patterns; each tag's centre is placed from the sticker's two reference holes with the Figure 9-15 layout (centres 2.75 in above the hole line, at -6.5/-2.75/+2.75/+6.5 in), IDs rising left to right as read from below with the hole edge (toward the field centre) at the bottom; this order matches Figure 9-17. x/y/z/facing are for the HIVE as the CAD has it (cellState); 'tipped' is the same tag after its HIVE tips to the other rest position. 'up' = the tag's printed up (unit vector, simulator frame): in the sticker's plane, away from its hole edge; manual 9.9: the bottom edge faces the field centre. facingDeg = horizontal direction the tag faces, counterclockwise from +x; pitchDeg = how far the tag's face points below horizontal (-90 = straight down)."
}